      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE CHAMPION (4) kept fresh for this after racing well on the provincial circuit. Just under six weeks between runs when taken to the front for a tenacious third with the 59kg over 1400m at Kembla Grange. Kept up to the mark with a trial win over 1175m at Warwick Farm. Can overcome the sticky gate in this very weak Maiden. LAST TOUR (3) dropped in grade with an improved fourth in the small field over 1300m at Goulburn. Maps well again with the claim and expected to go close. ARGANTORATI (6) her two runs back have been better than they look and should appreciate the extra trip today. Can surprise at the good odds. GOLD EARTH (1) struggled in the heavy going again at his second run back with a tiring sixth over 1000m at Gosford. Expecting more in this grade on the good surface.",
